<div class="auth-card">
  <div class="auth-icon-badge"><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-mail"></use></svg></div>
  <p class="eyebrow">Satu langkah lagi</p>
  <h2>Verifikasi email Anda</h2>
  <p class="auth-lead">Kami mengirim tautan verifikasi ke <strong><%= user.email %></strong>. Buka tautan tersebut untuk mengaktifkan akun.</p>

  <div class="notice">
    <svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-shield"></use></svg>
    <span>Jika belum menerima email, periksa folder spam atau kirim ulang tautan di bawah.</span>
  </div>

  <form class="form-stack" data-auth-form="resend" novalidate>
    <div class="form-error" data-form-error hidden></div>
    <div class="form-success" data-form-success hidden></div>
    <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block" type="submit" data-submit>
      <span data-submit-label>Kirim ulang verifikasi</span>
      <span class="spinner" data-spinner hidden aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </button>
  </form>

  <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-block" type="button" data-logout>Keluar dari akun</button>
</div>
